  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu kai wa munkatshi muenu, bikaleye ne muena Kilisto mukuabo tshilumbu, udi ne dikamakama dia kutshilumbulula ku mpala kua bantu babi, ne kena uya nʼatshi kudi basanto? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuena bamanye ne, Basanto nebalumbuluishe ba ha buloba, anyi? Ne bikala ba ha buloba balumbuluishibua kunudi, nuenu kanuena bakanangane ne bilumbuluidi ebi bidi bihita bukese, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuena bamanye ne, Tuetu netulumbuluishe banjelo, anyi? Nunku bualu budi butamba kutukuata bua kulumbulula malu a mu muoyo utudi nʼau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku binuikala ne bilumbuluidi bia malu a mu muoyo utudi nʼau, nudi nuteka ha mutu habi bantu ba hatuhu ba mu ekelesia, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi ngamba bualu ebu bua kunufuisha bundu. Kakuena muena meshi umue munkatshi muenu udi mua kulumbuluila bana benu ba mu Kilisto bilumbu biabo, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi muanʼenu wa ma Kilisto udi ufunda mukuabo ku tshilumbuluidi, ne udi wenza nunku ku mpala kua badi kabai ne ditabusha, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, bualu ebu buakumana kulua dihanga dinene munkatshi muenu ne, Nudi nuikalangana ne bilumbu. Bualu budi butamba buimpe bua nuenu nuitabushe banuenzele bibi, nasha? Budi butamba buimpe bua nuenu nuitabushe banunyenge bintu, nasha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nuenu mene nudi nuenza bibi, nudi nunyenga bintu; nudi nuenzela bana benu ba mu Kilisto bualu ebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuena bamanye ne, Bantu babi kabena bahiana bukelenge bua Nzambi, anyi? Kanudingibu; bena tshiendenda, anyi bena mpingu, anyi bena masandi, anyi badileshi bu bakashi, anyi balume badi benzelangana malu a bundu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anyi bibi, anyi bena lukuka lua bintu, anyi bakuatshiki ba maluvu, anyi bahendanganyi, anyi banyengi ba bintu, kabena bahiana bukelenge bua Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuabo benu bakadi nunku; kadi nuakuvuibua, nuakajidibua, nuakabingishibua mu dina dia Mukelenge Yesu Kilisto, ne mu Nyuma wa Nzambi wetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meme ndi ne bukole bua kuenza malu onso, kadi malu onso kêna ankuatshisha. Ndi ne bukole bua kuenza malu onso, kadi tshiena nkokeshibua munshi mua bualu bumue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bia kudia bidiku bua difu, ne difu didiku bua bia kudia, kadi Nzambi neavuishe diodio ne biobio bu bintu bia tshianana. Mubidi kawenaku bua masandi, kadi udiku bua Mukelenge; ne Mukelenge udiku bua mubidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wakabisha Mukelenge ku lufu, neatubishe tuetu kabidi ku bukole buandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuena bamanye ne mibidi yenu idi bituha bia mubidi wa Kilisto, anyi? Nunku nengumushe bituha bia Kilisto bua kubivuisha bituha bia mukashi wa masandi, anyi? Nasha kakese! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyi kanuena bamanye ne, Walamata kudi mukashi wa masandi udi nʼandi mubidi umue, anyi? Bua Nzambi udi wamba ne, Bubidi buabo nebalue mubidi umue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walamata kudi Mukelenge udi nʼandi nyuma umue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyemai masandi. Bubi buonso budi muntu wenza kabuena bua mu mubidi, kadi udi wenda masandi udi wenzela mubidi wandi mene bibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyi, kanuena bamanye ne mubidi wenu udi ntempelo wa Nyuma Muimpe udi munda muenu, unudi nuangata kudi Nzambi, anyi? Kanuena bena mioyo yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua nuakasumbibua ku mushinga mukole; nunku nutumbishe Nzambi mu mubidi wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
